<p>To Debug HTTP traffic into any Dropwizard micro service, can easily be
done by enabling <code>DEBUG</code> logging on these two Jetty components:</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code><span class="nt">logging</span><span class="p">:</span>
<span class="w">  </span><span class="nt">level</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="l l-Scalar l-Scalar-Plain">ERROR</span>
<span class="w">  </span><span class="nt">loggers</span><span class="p">:</span>
<span class="w">    </span><span class="nt">org.eclipse.jetty.server.HttpChannel</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="l l-Scalar l-Scalar-Plain">DEBUG</span>
<span class="w">    </span><span class="nt">org.eclipse.jetty.http.HttpParser</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="l l-Scalar l-Scalar-Plain">DEBUG</span>
</code></pre></div>

